{
  "title": "Juicy Italian Tiger Prawns Skewers",
  "description": "A resinous and creamy Italian dish featuring tiger prawns grilled on a cedar plank, inspired by Roman cuisine and ayurvedic-rajasic friendly principles.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
